        0,
        0,
        71,
        30,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 431,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "It won't be long before I myself can survive the sun's light. I will become the perfect entity.",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0010:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        233,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        240,
        29,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 439,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Many, many years ago... I once took in and raised orphans single-handedly at a small temple.",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0020:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        234,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        240,
        29,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 440,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Until one night, when a child encountered a demon. To save his own life, he invited it to feed on me and the other eight children.",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0030:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        235,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        240,
        29,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 441,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Four of them were slaughtered immediately, and although I tried to protect the others, only Sayo, the youngest, hid behind me and survived the night.",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0040:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        236,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        240,
        29,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 442,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Again and again, I continued to slam my fists against the demon's head... until daybreak.",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0050:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        237,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        240,
        29,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 443,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "That night I nearly lost everything. It left me beaten and broken. I had risked my life to protect little Sayo, yet...",
  },
  "APK2_BSG01_MemoryFragment_025_0060:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        35,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        238,
