        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 4734,
    "idSub": 1611,
    "message": "Since the day I was born, I've never once uttered a lie. As pitiful as I am, nobody shows me any sympathy!",
