  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0000_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10284,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Progress the story by heading to locations marked with <otherId_Icon_Main01/> on your map and by talking to characters.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0001_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10285,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "You have two maps at your disposal: the minimap and the full map. Located in the upper right corner of your screen is the minimap. The minimap allows you to view your immediate surroundings. To view the entire area, access the full map with <kcId_kcId_Field_Map/>.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0002_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10286,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Kimetsu Points can be found on the ground in different areas. Collected Kimetsu Points may be used at the Kimetsu Points Shop.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0002_05:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10287,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Walls and roofs that you can jump or climb on are indicated with a mark. Look around for the mark when you're not sure where to go.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0003_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10289,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "While exploring an area as Tanjiro, you can use <kcId_kcId_Field_Smell/> to track scents. Using this command will reveal a path, allowing you to follow the scent to its source.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0004_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10290,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Memory fragments allow you to watch past events with various characters. Once acquired, you can view them immediately with <kcId_kcId_Menu_Button_X/> or through the Storyline with <otherId_Icon_MemoryFragments/>.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0005_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10291,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Gear are items that activate during battle. Activating gear will give you different status effects, like raising your attack power or defense. Equip gear by going to Gear under the Game Menu.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0006_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10292,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The green bars at the top of the screen are the health gauges. To win, reduce your opponent's health to zero before your own health is reduced to zero.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0006_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10293,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The blue bars are the skill gauges. Using one of your skills will consume a portion of your skill gauge. The gauge will slowly refill as time in the battle passes.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0006_02:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10294,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When landing a hit, a circular timer will appear. This timer shows you how long you can continue your combo. Landing more attacks will extend the time. The length of the extended time depends on the type of attack and is signified by three colors: red, yellow, and green.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0007_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10295,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "If you have a support fighter, a yellow bar called the support gauge will be displayed. Press <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/> to summon your support fighter to help you during battle. Summoning your support fighter will consume a portion of your support gauge. The gauge will slowly refill over time.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0007_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10296,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Support fighters can do different actions to help you in battle, like use support skills or emergency escapes. Support skills attack the enemy, while an emergency escape enables the support fighter to help you when you get hit.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0007_02:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10297,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The support gauge is shared between your main and support fighters. Switch fighters by holding down <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/>.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0008_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10298,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The bar at the bottom of the screen is the special gauge, which fills as you deal or receive damage. Once it fills, you will gain a special bar. You can stock up to two special bars. Consume special bars to Boost or use an Ultimate Art.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0011_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10299,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro has a special ability called Emotional Essence. This ability allows him to sense the emotions of characters he's speaking with. Activate it by using <kcId_kcId_Field_Smell/> when Tanjiro is in the middle of certain conversations.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0011_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10300,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Emotional Essence visualizes emotions as colors. Use these colors to determine the best course of action.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0011_02:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10301,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Colors are linked to specific emotions as follows.
Yellow: Joy / Red: Anger / Blue: Worry",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0012_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10302,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In certain areas, there are people marked with <otherId_Icon_FreeMission/>. If you speak to one of them, you may receive a subquest. Completing subquests will earn you items.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0015_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10303,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When the button icons that scroll across the screen align with the target, press the corresponding button. Win the game by exceeding the minimum target score.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0017_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10304,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When playing as Zenitsu, you can use his Keen Hearing ability with <kcId_kcId_Field_Smell/>. Eavesdrop on conversations by targeting with <kcId_kcId_Field_Camera/> and pressing <kcId_kcId_Field_Action/> in the area you hear the conversation coming from.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0019_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10305,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When playing as Inosuke, you can use his Spatial Awareness ability with <kcId_kcId_Field_Smell/>. If you're in an area where there is a trace of a demon, go near it and investigate further with <kcId_kcId_Field_Action/>.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0020_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10306,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When the button icons that scroll across the screen align with the target, press the corresponding button. Win the game by exceeding the minimum target score.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0021_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10307,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When the button icons that scroll across the screen align with the target, hold down the corresponding button to fill up the power gauge. Then repeatedly press the button to push the boulder. Push the boulder farther than the goal to win.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0021_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10308,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "There are two button icons used per set to store up power. Hold down the first button icon and release once the second button icon aligns with the target.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0022_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10309,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "If you are defeated in a battle and want to retry the battle from the beginning, select "Restart Battle."",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0022_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10310,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Heal and continue the battle by selecting Continue.
※Selecting this option will prevent you from achieving the highest rank.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0023_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10311,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "You can experience the Hinokami Chronicles from this screen. The story is divided into multiple locked chapters. Completing a chapter will unlock the next one.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0026_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10312,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "If you're hit with a poisonous attack, you'll be poisoned and your health will continue to diminish. The poisoned status effect will either disappear over time or once you switch out.
※Because Uzui is resistant to poison, he'll lose less health when afflicted.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0027_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10313,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "View your Battle Attire, profile photos, quotes, stamps, music tracks, and Hinokami Records here.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0028_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10314,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In a battle with multiple opponents, change which opponent you're actively targeting with <kcId_kcId_Battle_Target/>. Change targets as the tide of battle shifts.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0030_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10315,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Learn a character's controls or combos in Practice Mode. Utilize various settings to get the most out of your training.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0032_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10316,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Boost by spending a stocked special bar. For a limited time, Boost allows you to enter a heightened state that increases your attack power, along with other status effects.
※Once time runs out, you'll return to normal.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0035_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10317,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Your overall Chapter Rank in the Storyline is determined by your rank in each battle and minigame within that chapter. Play multiple times and aim to get the highest rank of S!",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0038_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10318,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Select your fighters and battlefield in Online Match Settings before matching with an opponent.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0039_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10319,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In a Group Match, battle up to eight people within a group. You can play three different types of Vs Mode in a Group Match: Solo Battle, Team Battle, and Tournament.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0039_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10320,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Fight one-on-one in Solo Battle or split into two teams in Team Battle and compete for the most wins.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0039_02:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10321,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In the tournament, participants will compete to win, but in the event of a draw, the winner will be decided at random.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0040_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10322,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Check your Slayer ID to view your Battle Record, which will show your scores in Online Matches and Endurance Matches.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0040_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10323,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "After an Online Match ends, trade Slayer IDs with your opponent to view their information.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0044_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10324,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Characters marked with a <otherId_Icon_DEMON/> in the character selection screen cannot have a support fighter.
※This is applicable to demons and unique characters.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0052_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10325,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Train under a Hashira in Training Paths. Aim towards reaching the final tile to face the Hashira. The type of training you'll undergo in each session will differ depending on the tiles you choose to stop at.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0053_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10326,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In Endurance Match, defeat all enemies within the time limit, or aim to defeat as many as you can until you run out of health.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0054_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10327,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Experience an abridged version of the battles Tanjiro and friends have endured in The Path of a Demon Slayer. Earn rewards depending on how well you complete the mode.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0056_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10328,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Take down Sekido while avoiding attacks from Karaku and Urogi. No matter how many times you defeat Karaku and Urogi, they'll just keep getting back up.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0057_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10329,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In Crowd Combat, defeat the required number of enemies in order to win. Similar to how you move around an area, move your character and adjust the camera while taking down enemies.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0058_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10330,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Access gear, character masteries, Archives, Slayer IDs, the Kimetsu Points Shop, Tutorials, and Options from the Game Menu.",
  },
  "Tutorial_APK2_text_0059_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
