    "id": 9439,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "As he searches for the secret weapon, Tanjiro comes across Kotetsu and Muichiro Tokito, the Mist Hashira. Intent on exacting revenge on Muichiro, Kotetsu trains Tanjiro using the Yoriichi Type Zero.",
