        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8166,
    "idSub": 1041,
    "message": "An axe...",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line:1051" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8166,
    "idSub": 1051,
    "message": "I first met Mr. Giyu right after Nezuko was turned into a demon.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line:1061" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8166,
    "idSub": 1061,
    "message": "He was there to cut her down, but I attempted to stop him with my axe.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line:1071" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8166,
    "idSub": 1071,
    "message": "...I need to show him how much stronger I've become since then. That's the only way I can repay him for showing us mercy.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0010:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8137,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Though not part of the Demon Slayer Corps, the Wisteria House assists demon slayers at no charge to repay the Corps for saving them in the past.

After their mission at the Drum Mansion, the elderly lady prepared food and had a doctor tend to the boys. She also wished them good fortune with a ceremony in which she struck sparks with flintstone.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0020:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8138,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "During his time training under Urokodaki, Tanjiro wrote a journal for Nezuko, who was in a deep sleep.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0030:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8139,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In the Kamado family, it was tradition to make rice crackers after a festival by pounding old mochi.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0040:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8140,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro made a living by making and selling charcoal in the village, but most of his trips there had him assisting in various tasks, such as repairing sliding doors or identifying the culprit who shattered a set of plates.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0050:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8141,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Before boarding the Mugen Train, Rengoku took down a demon known as the Slasher. He received a generous helping of bento from the vendors he saved and enjoyed his meals on the train.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0060:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8142,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The Asakusa udon stall owner Toyo was born and raised in Asakusa. He loves Asakusa, so he cooks and sells udon in Asakusa.

Though initially upset that Nezuko didn't eat his udon, once Tanjiro wolfed down not one, but TWO bowls and gave him a glowing review, Toyo happily saw them off.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0070:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8143,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Inosuke likes playing games with Tanjiro and friends, but he loves battledore. Recently, he's been into "Super High Speed Battledore," where the shuttlecock goes flying back and forth at incredible speeds.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0080:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8144,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro's favorite onigiri filling is plum seaweed, and Zenitsu's is salmon.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0090:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8145,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Inosuke thoroughly enjoyed the tempura he had at the Wisteria House. When the elderly lady told him they were having tempura for dinner, it made him feel all warm and fuzzy inside.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0100:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8146,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Zenitsu is able to play the shamisen or koto after hearing it once, all due to his keen hearing. He became quite skilled at the shamisen while undercover at House Kyogoku.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0110:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8147,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Zenitsu would snack on steamed buns when he skipped out on rehabilitation training at the Butterfly Mansion. He also brought some to Tanjiro while he was bedridden after the Mugen Train mission.

He didn't ask if he could take the steamed buns on either occasion.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0130:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8148,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A wisteria sachet is used to ward off demons.

Tanjiro's crow threw up one to give to Kiyoshi, a rareblood Tanjiro met back at the Drum Mansion, so that it would be harder for demons to target him in the future.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0140:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8149,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Haganezuka's favorite snack.

After Tanjiro lost his sword, Haganezuka only calmed down when he was offered some dango. It's a good idea to buy him some whenever he's angry.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0150:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8150,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro encountered Sabito and Makomo on Mt. Sagiri. Sabito himself would spar with Tanjiro while Makomo corrected his forms. Thanks to their assistance, Tanjiro was able to complete Urokodaki's challenge: splitting a boulder in two.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0160:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8151,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Before they met Urokodaki, Tanjiro would carry Nezuko in a basket he repaired so that they could journey during the day.

When he received the bamboo and straw needed to repair the old basket, the previous owner didn't want any reimbursement, but Tanjiro insisted and paid for it before leaving.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0170:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8152,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In order to achieve Total Concentration: Constant, Tanjiro requested the girls at the Butterfly Mansion to hit him with the carpet beaters if he stopped breathing properly.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0180:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8153,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The Nichirin sword is also known as the color-changing katana, as its color will change depending on the bearer. Each hue has its own unique properties.

However, very few have obtained a black blade like Tanjiro, so not much is known about them. That's why it's said those with black swords aren't likely to amount to anything.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0190:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8154,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Haganezuka brings his own knife to chase after Tanjiro for breaking and losing his swords. They're so dangerously sharp that they're not safe to use for cooking.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0200:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8155,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "After their mission on Mt. Natagumo, Tanjiro and friends had rehabilitation training at the Butterfly Mansion, where they learned Total Concentration: Constant.

Though Tanjiro had difficulty figuring it out at first, he managed to complete his training with Kiyo, Naho, and Sumi's support.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0210:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8156,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Haganezuka has wind chimes attached to his bamboo hat. He's liked them ever since he was young. In fact, back when he was a child, the adults would calm him down during his temper tantrums by ringing wind chimes.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0220:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8157,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Angelica tree shoots are Tanjiro's favorite dish.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0230:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8158,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "After Zenitsu was deceived by a woman he liked, his master took him under his wing. Though his training was strict, he saw Zenitsu's potential and made him into a swordsman.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0240:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8159,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The medicinal tea used during reflex training has a foul smell to it. Although Tanjiro did win against Kanao, he hesitated splashing her with the tea and instead placed the cup on her head.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0250:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8160,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A fish bowl for Shinobu's pet goldfish. Zenitsu took it to show Nezuko without permission, but Aoi found out and gave him a scolding.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0260:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8161,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Muichiro's hobbies include papercutting and origami. The paper airplanes he makes always seem to fly forever.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0270:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8162,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When Mitsuri was one year and two months old, she tried to help her mother, who was pregnant with her brother at the time, by lifting a 33-pound pickling stone.

Her mother was known for her strong nerves, but her hip gave out for the first time ever.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0280:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8163,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Mitsuri ate 170 sakura mochi a day for eight months, which caused her hair and eyes to change to their current colors.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0290:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8164,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The Demon Slayer Corps uniform is made with a special kind of fiber that's lightweight, water-resistant, and non-flammable. It won't tear even when attacked by the claws and fangs of a weak demon.",
  },
  "PictureBook_Description_0300:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8165,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro first encountered Giyu shortly after Nezuko was turned into a demon. Giyu was there to slay Nezuko, but Tanjiro, armed with only an axe, was determined to stop him.",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S11:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9566,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "It seems that the head of the Wisteria House and his sister have a problem. Will Tanjiro be able to help them out?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9560,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Tanjiro receives permission to accompany Shinobu on her mission, but since the task calls for a Hashira, will Tanjiro successfully pull through?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S04:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9561,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Chuntaro alerts Zenitsu of his next mission, but will he actually manage to defeat a demon on his own?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S05:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9562,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Inosuke is requested by a fellow slayer to defeat a demon that uses poison. Will he overcome this vile foe?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S06:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9563,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Who is stronger? Smarter? In a twist of events, Zenitsu serves as witness to Inosuke and Murata's showdown.",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S08:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9564,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A demon was spotted at the flower field Zenitsu wants to visit with Nezuko. Will he be able to vanquish the demon and save their special place?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S09:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9565,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "While visiting the Butterfly Mansion, Hinatsuru, Makio, and Suma reflect on their shortcomings on the last mission and ask to train with Tanjiro. What will be the outcome of this match?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S13:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9567,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A swordsmith is worried that he'll never be able to reconcile with his best friend. Will Tanjiro's intervention restore their friendship?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S15:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9568,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "The paper airplane that a child made was blown away by the wind. Will Tanjiro be able to locate the missing plane?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S22:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9569,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A demon slayer, exhausted after training, just wants to eat his favorite food: fish. Will Tanjiro be able to serve him a meal and cheer him up?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S23:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9570,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "A demon slayer is challenging others on their knowledge of the Hashira. Can Tanjiro answer his questions correctly?",
  },
  "Summary_OnQuest_S24:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
