        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 9822,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Zenitsu calls his Kasugai Sparrow "Chuntaro," but he is actually named Ukogi after his favorite food, ukogi rice. Unfortunately, Zenitsu doesn't know this and just feeds him beans.",
  },
