  },
  "Tutorial_text_0093_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10569,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In a group match, up to 8 players can join together in the same lobby.

Two players face off at a time while the others spectate.
Press <kcId_kcId_Battle_Pause/> to leave a group while spectating. Group matches do not increase or decrease rank points. Additionally, if no matches are played within ten minutes with at least two players in the group, the group will be disbanded.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0093_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10570,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Join Group
　　This option will filter all groups by your chosen criteria and connect you with one that matches.
　　If no matching groups are found, you can create your own.
　　Groups created this way can be joined by anyone.
　　Choose this option when you want to play against random opponents.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0093_02:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10571,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Create Private Group
　　This option will create a new group with your chosen criteria.
　　Each private group is assigned a 12-digit number.
　　Groups created this way can be found by searching the group number.
　　Choose this option when you want to play against specific opponents.

Search Group Number
　　When you want to join another player's private group, enter its 12-digit number here.",
  },
