    "message": "Customizing Your Slayer ID",
  },
  "Tutorial_title_0079_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10660,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Slayer ID Directory",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0076_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10544,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "You must decide which fighters to use and what battlefield to play on before you are matched with an opponent. Make these selections in the Choose Fighters/Battlefield menu.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0076_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10545,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Generally, an online match will be played on the battlefield Player 1 has chosen, but there is an exception. If Player 1 chooses a battlefield with a <otherId_Icon_DAYLIGHT/> icon and Player 2 chooses a demon fighter, Player 2's battlefield will be chosen instead. If "Change Fighters/Battlefield" is selected at the end of the match, Player 1 will get to choose the new battlefield.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0077_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10546,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Your Slayer ID keeps a record of your online matches. Check it to see your Battle Record.

You'll also trade IDs with your opponent after each match, so you'll be able to view their information as well.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0078_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10547,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "By choosing "Profile Photos" or "Quotes," you can customize your Slayer ID with the profile photos and quotes you have collected.

Make your very own ID and show it off to other players in online matches!",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0079_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10548,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In the Directory, you can view the Slayer IDs you have received.

You can store up to 30 IDs in total. If you exceed this number, the oldest will automatically be deleted. To save your favorite IDs and prevent them from being deleted, you can choose to follow them (max 20).",
  },
