  "Tutorial_text_0080_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10549,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Online missions are only available for a limited time. You can get Kimetsu Points by completing challenges while these missions are active.

Daily Missions
Missions you can complete every day.

Seasonal Missions
Missions that change on a regular schedule.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0080_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10550,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Grudge Match
A limited-time event. When fighters allied with the Demon Slayer Corps compete against a demon fighter in a ranked match, the winner is awarded Kimetsu Points.

Check the details of each mission type in the Online Mission menu.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0081_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10552,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Demons always fight alone (excluding Nezuko and Academy Nezuko).

When selecting a fighter, a <otherId_Icon_DEMON/> icon indicates that the character will fight solo.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0082_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10553,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "In place of a support gauge, demons (excluding Nezuko and Academy Nezuko) have a demon gauge, depicted by two red bars.

You can perform two different actions by pressing <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/> when at least 50% (1 bar) of the demon gauge is full.

The demon gauge will replenish naturally over time.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0082_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10554,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Demon Skills

By pressing <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/> or tilting <kcId_kcId_Battle_Move/> and pressing <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/>, you can unleash powerful attacks. These attacks consume 50% of the demon gauge.

Press <kcId_kcId_Battle_Support/> when attacked by the opponent to perform an emergency escape. This will consume 100% of the demon gauge.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0083_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10555,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When a demon (excluding Nezuko and Academy Nezuko) begins to Boost or Surge, their skill and demon gauges will be completely refilled and their HP will start to replenish. More HP will be healed with Surge compared to Boost. However, performing a Quick Step, guarding, or getting attacked by the opponent will temporarily interrupt the healing and reduce the total amount healed.",
  },
