        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10556,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Yahaba attacks by launching arrows. These arrows do not do damage themselves, but can stagger your opponent and create an opportunity for follow-up attacks.

You can also damage your opponent by using arrows to slam them into the ground or throw rocks at them.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0088_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10560,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "If you come in contact with poison from an opponent or a puddle on the ground, you will be afflicted with the poison, causing your health to gradually deplete. The poison status will cure itself in time or when you switch out, but it's best to avoid it from the start.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0089_00:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        128,
        9,
        4,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10561,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "Online missions are only available for a limited time. You can get Kimetsu Points by completing challenges while these missions are active.

Daily Missions
Missions you can complete every day.

Seasonal Missions
Missions that change on a regular schedule.",
  },
  "Tutorial_text_0089_01:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
