        255,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 10557,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "When playing as Yushiro & Tamayo, you will take control of Yushiro.

As with other demons, he can use demon skills and emergency escape, but cannot switch out with Tamayo. Instead, Tamayo will support Yushiro when he uses his demon skills.",
  },
